{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"crossbow","model_identifier":"crossbow","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## crossbow\n\nRanged weapon, iron.\n\n- Cubes: 10 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -10.0..10.0, y -2.8..1.8, z -22.5..9.0 (size 20.0 x 4.5 x 31.5 u = 56 x 13 x 89 cm).\nIron crossbow: oak stock with a deep butt, iron prod 20 u wide, stirrup at the front for spanning with the foot, long trigger lever under the stock, string spanned to the nut, bolt loaded. Grip (right hand at the trigger) at the origin; the prod is 17 u forward (-Z), butt 9 u back (to the shoulder). Second grip (left hand under the stock) 7.3 u forward (warrior_base crossbow_shoot). Iron grade textures.\n- Embedded texture: iron_refined. Tier textures: iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_refined.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `crossbow_iron_bloom.png`, `crossbow_iron_wrought.png`, `crossbow_iron_refined.png`\n"},"description":"## crossbow\n\nRanged weapon, iron.\n\n- Cubes: 10 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -10.0..10.0, y -2.8..1.8, z -22.5..9.0 (size 20.0 x 4.5 x 31.5 u = 56 x 13 x 89 cm).\nIron crossbow: oak stock with a deep butt, iron prod 20 u wide, stirrup at the front for spanning with the foot, long trigger lever under the stock, string spanned to the nut, bolt loaded. Grip (right hand at the trigger) at the origin; the prod is 17 u forward (-Z), butt 9 u back (to the shoulder). Second grip (left hand under the stock) 7.3 u forward (warrior_base crossbow_shoot). Iron grade textures.\n- Embedded texture: iron_refined. Tier textures: iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_refined.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `crossbow_iron_bloom.png`, `crossbow_iron_wrought.png`, `crossbow_iron_refined.png`\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":32},"elements":[{